/*
 * MergeShip2 -- the settings Ship of Harkinian (SoH) shares with 2 Ship 2 Harkinian (2Ship) in mergeship.exe.
 * X-macro table, maintained by hand; read by include/mergeship/SettingsSync.h and checked by
 * tools/check_settings_map.py (both names exist in their codebase, the defaults match the code's).
 *
 *   MS_SETTING(sohName, shipName, sohType, shipType, sohDefault, shipDefault, xform, flags)
 *
 * One row per 2Ship CVar that means the same as a SoH CVar (by meaning, not by name). SoH is the source of truth: on
 * every resume of 2Ship (every trip through the door, every Ctrl+F12, and at 2Ship's start) each row's SoH value, or
 * sohDefault when SoH has none, goes through `xform` into 2Ship's CVar. A value changed in 2Ship's own menu goes back
 * to SoH when 2Ship is suspended (last writer wins), except for MS_F_TO_2SHIP rows.
 *
 *   types   MS_T_INT, MS_T_FLOAT, MS_T_COLOR (a colour: copied as it is, RGBA or RGB; defaults unused)
 *   xform   MS_X_SAME        the same value
 *           MS_X_NOT         a checkbox with the opposite sense
 *           MS_X_BOOL        SoH's number -> on/off (one-way rows)
 *           MS_X_PCT         SoH's 0-100 slider <-> 2Ship's 0.0-1.0 slider
 *           MS_X_DAMAGE      SoH's damage multiplier list (1x..128x, OHKO) <-> 2Ship's (1x..16x, 1 Hit KO)
 *           MS_X_MIRROR      SoH's mirrored world modes <-> 2Ship's (MQ-only dungeons: Termina has none)
 *           MS_X_CROUCHSTAB  SoH "Remove Power Crouch Stab" <-> 2Ship "Power Crouch Stab" (Patched / Unpatched OoT)
 *           MS_X_SPEEDMODE   SoH "Toggle modifier instead of holding" -> 2Ship's speed modifier mode (hold/toggle)
 *           MS_X_FORM_TUNIC  the same value, only while SoH's "Form Tunic Colours" (Mergeship menu) is on: the Deku,
 *                            Goron and Zora wear the Kokiri Tunic's colour in Hyrule, so they do in Termina too
 *           MS_X_FD_TUNIC    the same value while SoH's "Form Tunic Colours" colours every form; otherwise (off, or
 *                            "Deku, Goron, Zora") the Fierce Deity keeps Majora's Mask's colours in Hyrule, so 2Ship's
 *                            tunic options read unchanged (BUG-0123)
 *   flags   MS_F_NONE
 *           MS_F_TO_2SHIP    one-way (the 2Ship option has no exact SoH counterpart to write back)
 *           MS_F_IF_SET      only once SoH has the CVar set: SoH's untouched default must not change 2Ship's
 *           MS_F_UNSET       same name, same code default in both (libultraship, the menus): SoH unset -> 2Ship unset
 *
 * Not shared (no counterpart, or not safely): see the list at the end of this file.
 */

