/*
 * Not shared:
 *   - Text Speed (1x-5x, instant): Majora's Mask has no text speed; its Fast Text is SoH's Skip Text (hold B), above.
 *   - Skip Intro / Skip to File Select / Boot Sequence: SoH's skip Ocarina of Time's own intro; 2Ship's Skip Intro
 *     Sequence skips Majora's Mask's whole opening, which the door plays on a file's first visit (MergeShipHost.h).
 *   - Vine/Ladder Climb Speed (+0..+12) vs Climb Speed (1x..5x), Crawl Speed, King Zora Speed: different scales or no
 *     counterpart.
 *   - ImGui Menu Scaling: the one ImGui context is shared and each game scales it relative to its own last scale;
 *     syncing the index without that state would scale twice.
 *   - Search In Sidebar: the menus insert/remove their search entry only from their own widget callback.
 *   - Renderer / audio API, window size and position: one window and one audio device, owned by the first engine.
 *   - Controller bindings, rumble, LEDs, gyro: one ControlDeck, already shared by both engines.
 *   - HUD layout (SoH's per-element position/scale vs 2Ship's HUD Editor), Mirror Shield, gauntlet and boot colours:
 *     different elements or models (2Ship's Ocarina of Time gauntlets and boots have no colour option).
 *   - Persistent Masks (SoH) vs Persistent Bunny Hood (2Ship), Bunny Hood effect: different features.
 *   - Language, Text to Speech, Disable Idle Camera, heat haze / Jabu wobble: no 2Ship counterpart.
 */
